    "en": "Sand and Granite Quarries Act\n(CHAPTER 284, Section 3)\nAppointment of Licensing Officer\nN 1\nREVISED EDITION 2001\n(31st January 2001)\n[26th May 1999]\nThe Minister for National Development has appointed the Director, Business Development Division, Building and Construction Authority, to be the Licensing Officer for the purposes of the Act."
